4. Your workspace content
   Everything the Software creates in your workspaces (configuration, task scripts, schema snapshots,
   documentation generated from your databases, support reports) belongs to you. The workspace scaffold files
   (AGENTS.md, docs, templates, hooks) may be modified and shared freely.

5. Data and privacy
   The Software runs on your devices and sends no telemetry to the copyright holder. Database credentials are
   stored in your operating system's credential vault. The optional chat feature sends prompts, schema information
   and capped query results to Anthropic's API using your own API key, under your own agreement with Anthropic.
   You decide whether that is acceptable for your data.

